scenario fluorescent room, people moving in front, lamp off: no dose accrues (TP11)
room 3 fluor
wobble 0.1                     # +/-10% as people pass
boot
within 9 state == DARK_IDLE
wait 60
expect spent == 0
expect events == 0
hand 1
wait 3
expect lamp_lux > 3            # the lamp is still measured against the fluorescent room
